        Menu-permission tree consumed by the etp-flutter app.
        Each api.role.line.menu_name must exactly match a key in the app's
        sidebar registry (dashboard_shell.dart). The Flutter sidebar renders an
        item only when its permission node has is_visible=true AND the id is a
        known registry key. is_visible is true for a line when that line is in
        the logged-in user's role.line_ids (see get_the_menuitem_list).

        The role -> line links, endpoint grants and user assignments are applied
        by api.role._sync_pod_role_config() (see data/pod_roles_sync.xml) so they
        reproduce on both install and upgrade.
    -->
